'''Bath Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] increases its health and attack rate. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]].

